//   (Pellridge night operators), 7:51 AM M-2231 (day shift); Thu Mar 4, 3:05 AM M-2187 (Meridian night supervisor), 7:12 AM
//   P-0117, 7:49 AM M-2252 (day shift). Badge M-2040 (Beth Nyland) has no reads at any Meridian door March 1 to 12. Entry reader
//   only, anti-passback off, door held open alarm disabled June 2024, settlement room camera kept 14 days. Overnight desk roster
//   (midnight to 8 AM) both nights: Pellridge night operator 1 (P-0117), night operator 2 (P-0122), Meridian night supervisor
