//   24, design only, roster in Appendix C "as provided by Pellridge"; other path: Pellridge's counsel sent a letter and roster summary
//   via Meridian's counsel "as a courtesy". Either way Teresa wrote to Pellridge's counsel only on the best pick. Database: shared
//   DBA account pell_dba (4 Pellridge staff) can change any table; data change auditing off on queue and settings tables since
