//   badges, all service areas, 24 hours, no expiry, paper sign out, C-14 not signed out March 8, engineering shift log "board
//   full" March 10, 6:02 AM; never reconciled. Lou bet Irma five dollars Henry would sit (she paid on the paths where he did). System admin: one shared account (engineering manager, two leads, vendor support), can edit and
